  "image": "/images/posts/885.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Avanza la pavimentación de la ruta costera Maullín–Amortajado, que contempla los tramos El Pangal–Amortajado (5 km) y Maullín–El Pangal (1,3 km).</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La obra, ejecutada por Constructora Lleuques, se encuentra en su etapa final, con trabajos de señalización y cierre de observaciones técnicas.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Un proyecto que mejora la conectividad y la seguridad vial para los sectores costeros de nuestra comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fuente: munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-39 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-892\" data-id=\"892\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/zgs7ko95cstezbk/img_20251128_wa0028_1024x576_fx5893k827.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-888\" data-id=\"888\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/rxkma6klcz3pdgh/img_20251128_wa0029_1024x576_tw486mn1up.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-887\" data-id=\"887\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/pwoqm8nqx9i90uk/img_20251128_wa0030_1024x576_t5z9q81n36.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp